## User question:
How to configure Huawei router's BGP-VPNv6 address family to minimize MPLS label consumption when routes share the same next hop and outgoing label?
---
## Proposed answer:
mpls label mode per-flow
bgp vpnv6 unicast enable
mpls traffic-eng tunnels
interface GigabitEthernet0/0/1
mpls traffic-eng tunnels
quit
---
## Router configuration manual:
CLIs:
apply-label per-nexthop
