## User question:
How to configure a Huawei router to allow selection of 8 different routes for the same destination prefix in a BGP VPNv4 environment?
---
## Proposed answer:
ip as-path access-list 1 permit ^$
bgp 100
ipv4-family vpnv4
prefix-list PL seq 5 permit 0.0.0.0/0 le 32
route-policy RP permit node 10
route-policy RP
if-match ip-prefix PL
apply path-count 8
---
