## User question:
How to configure Huawei router to allow up to 8 equal-cost EBGP and IBGP routes for load balancing while preserving original next-hop addresses during route advertisement?
---
## Proposed answer:
system-view
bpg group1 type external
bpg group1 peer 1.1.1.1 as-number 65001
bpg group1 peer 2.2.2.2 as-number 65001
bpg group1 peer 3.3.3.3 as-number 65001
bpg group1 peer 4.4.4.4 as-number 65001
bpg group1 peer 5.5.5.5 as-number 65001
bpg group1 peer 6.6.6.6 as-number 65001
bpg group1 peer 7.7.7.7 as-number 65001
bpg group1 peer 8.8.8.8 as-number 65001
bpg group1 load-balance 8
bpg group1 undo maximum-paths 1
bpg group1 maximum-paths 8
bpg group1 ebgp-load-balance
bpg group1 ibgp-load-balance
