## User question:
How to configure a Huawei router to allow BGP route exchange with peer group "vpn_customers" in the VPNv4 address family?
---
## Proposed answer:
peer vpn_customers enable-vpnv4
peer vpn_customers peer-group
---
## Router configuration manual:
CLIs:
peer <group-name> enable
undo peer <group-name> enable
FuncDef:
The peer enable command enables a BGP device to exchange routes with a specified peer group in the address family view.
