## User question:
How to configure a Huawei router to use GigabitEthernet 1/0/1 with source address 192.168.50.1 for sending BGP packets to peer group "WEST_GROUP"?
---
## Proposed answer:
interface GigabitEthernet 1/0/1
ip address 192.168.50.1 255.255.255.0
bgp 100
peer-group WEST_GROUP
peer WEST_GROUP connect-interface GigabitEthernet 1/0/1
---
