## User question:
How to configure a Huawei router to generate a summary default BGP route for routes matching IPv4 prefix list "customer-routes" with route attributes modified by route-policy "set-metric"?
---
## Proposed answer:
ip ip-prefix customer-routes index 10 permit 0.0.0.0 32 greater-equal 32 less-equal 32
route-policy set-metric permit node 10
if-match ip-prefix customer-routes
apply cost 100
quit
bgp 100
ipv4-family vpnv4
aggregate default-route origin-ip-prefix customer-routes attribute-policy set-metric
---
## Router configuration manual:
