## Router configuration manual:
CLIs:
reflect between-clients
undo reflect between-clients
FuncDef:
The reflect between-clients command enables route reflection among clients through the RR.
The undo reflect between-clients command disables route reflection among clients through the RR. If the clients of an RR are fully meshed, you can prohibit route reflection among clients through the RR to reduce the cost.
By default, route reflection among clients through the RR is enabled.
