## User question:
How to configure Huawei router BGP-IPv4 unicast address family to allow up to 8 equal-cost EBGP routes for load balancing while modifying only participating routes' next-hop addresses?
---
## Proposed answer:
system-view
bgp 100
ipv4-family unicast
maximum load-balancing ebgp 8 ecmp-nexthop-changed
---
## Router configuration manual:
CLIs:
