## User question:
How to configure Huawei router BGP multi-instance VPN to advertise only routes that are both selected by BGP and active in the routing management layer?
---
## Proposed answer:
sys
bpg 100
undo peer all enable
peer 10.0.0.2 as-number 200
undo peer 10.0.0.2 enable
undo peer 10.0.0.2 route-policy import
peer 10.0.0.2 route-policy export
route-policy export permit node 10
if-match bgp-routing-table-entry
exit
undo ipv4-family vpnv4
ipv4-family vpnv4 100
undo aggregate-network 0.0.0.0 0
undo maximum-paths 8
undo default-route-advertise
undo default-route-advertise always
undo default-route imported
undo peer 10.0.0.2 activate
peer 10.0.0.2 activate
exit
exit
