{'Parameters': 'check-withdraw-type', 'Info': 'Checks whether the route type in a Withdraw message received from a peer is the same as the type of a local route to be withdrawn (route previously received from the peer). If the route types are consistent, the local route is withdrawn. (Two types of routes are involved: labeled routes and unlabeled routes). By default, a device is enabled to check whether the route type in a received Withdraw message is the same as the type of a local route to be withdrawn.\n-'}
