Configure BGP on a Huawei router to summarize the 192.168.64.0/18 prefix while preserving AS path information and suppressing detailed routes.
---
## Proposed answer:

---
## Router configuration manual:
CLIs:
aggregate <ipv4-address> { <mask-length> | <mask> } [ as-set | detail-suppressed | attribute-policy <route-policy-name1> | origin-policy <route-policy-name2> | suppress-policy <route-policy-name3> ] *
aggregate <ipv4-address> { <mask-length> | <mask> } [ as-set | detail-suppressed ] { attribute-filter <attr-filter-name> | origin-filter <orig-filter-name> | suppress-filter <supp-filter-name> } *
aggregate <ipv4-address> { <mask-length> | <mask> } as-set detail-suppressed { attribute-filter <attr-filter-name> | origin-filter <orig-filter-name> | suppress-filter <supp-filter-name> } *
undo aggregate <ipv4-address> { <mask-length> | <mask> } [ as-set | detail-suppressed | attribute-policy <route-policy-name1> | origin-policy <route-policy-name2> | suppress-policy <route-policy-name3> ] *
undo aggregate <ipv4-address> { <mask-length> | <mask> } [ as-set | detail-suppressed ] { attribute-filter <attr-filter-name> | origin-filter <orig-filter-name> | suppress-filter <supp-filter-name> } *
undo aggregate <ipv4-address> { <mask-length> | <mask> } as-set detail-suppressed { attribute-filter <attr-filter-name> | origin-filter <orig-filter-name> | suppress-filter <supp-filter-name> } *
FuncDef:
The aggregate command adds a summarized route to the BGP routing table. The outbound interface of the summarized route on the local Router is NULL 0. When receiving the summarized route, each of the other Routers automatically adds its local outbound interface to the summarized route.
The undo aggregate command disables the function.
By default, no routes are summarized.
ParaDef:
{'Parameters': 'ipv4-address', 'Info': 'Specifies an IPv4 address of the summarized route. The address is in dotted decimal notation.\nIt is in dotted decimal notation.'}
{'Parameters': 'mask-length', 'Info': 'Specifies the network mask length of the summarized route.\nThe value is an integer ranging from 1 to 32.'}
{'Parameters': 'mask', 'Info': 'Specifies the network mask of the summarized route.\nIt is in dotted decimal notation.'}
{'Parameters': 'as-set', 'Info': 'Generates a route carrying AS-SET.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'detail-suppressed', 'Info': 'Advertises only the summarized route.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'attribute-policy route-policy-name1', 'Info': 'Specifies the name of an attribute route-policy for the summarized route.\nThe name is a string of 1 to 200 case-sensitive characters, with spaces not supported. When double quotation marks are used around the string, spaces are allowed in the string.'}
{'Parameters': 'origin-policy route-policy-name2', 'Info': 'Specifies the name of a route-policy that allows route summarization.\nThe name is a string of 1 to 200 case-sensitive characters, with spaces not supported. When double quotation marks are used around the string, spaces are allowed in the string.'}
