## User question:
Set the priority for EBGP routes to 10, IBGP routes to 15, and local BGP routes to 50 in a Huawei router's BGP multi-instance VPN instance IPv4 address family configuration.
---
## Proposed answer:
ip as-path-limit 16
ipv4-family vpn-instance <instance_name>
