## User question:
How to configure a Huawei router to summarize routes matching IPv4 prefix list "customer_routes" into a default route with attributes modified by route-policy "set_med_50"?
---
## Proposed answer:
ip ip-prefix customer_routes index 10 permit 0.0.0.0/0 less-equal 32
route-policy set_med_50 permit node 10
