## User question:
How to prevent specific IPv6 BGP routes matching a route policy named "INTERNAL_ONLY" from being installed into the IP routing table on Huawei routers?
---
## Proposed answer:
ip as-path access-list INTERNAL_ONLY deny _65000_
ipv6 route-policy INTERNAL_ONLY
if-match as-path-filter INTERNAL_ONLY
apply ipv6 prefix-list DROP_INTERNAL_ONLY
ipv6 prefix-list DROP_INTERNAL_ONLY seq 5 deny ::/0
undo ip as-path access-list INTERNAL_ONLY
---
