## Proposed answer:
bgp 100
ipv4-family vpnv4
peer XXX.XXX.XXX.XXX as-number 200
peer XXX.XXX.XXX.XXX ebgp-relation external
peer XXX.XXX.XXX.XXX next-hop-local
peer XXX.XXX.XXX.XXX preference 10
peer YYY.YYY.YYY.YYY as-number 200
peer YYY.YYY.YYY.YYY ebgp-relation internal
peer YYY.YYY.YYY.YYY next-hop-local
peer YYY.YYY.YYY.YYY preference 15
peer ZZZ.ZZZ.ZZZ.ZZZ as-number 100
peer ZZZ.ZZZ.ZZZ.ZZZ next-hop-local
peer ZZZ.ZZZ.ZZZ.ZZZ preference 50
