undo graceful-restart peer-reset
FuncDef:
The graceful-restart peer-reset command enables the Router to reset a BGP connection in GR mode.
The undo graceful-restart peer-reset command restores the default configuration.
By default, the Router is not enabled to reset a BGP connection in GR mode.
