## User question:
How to configure Huawei router to set EBGP route priority to 50, IBGP route priority to 60, and local route priority to 70 in BGP VPN instance IPv4 address family?
---
## Proposed answer:
bgp 100
ipv4-family vpn-instance test-instance
prefer-reload 70
peer 1.1.1.1 as-number 100
peer 1.1.1.1 ebgp-max-hop 1
peer 1.1.1.1 next-hop-local
peer 1.1.1.1 preference 50
peer 2.2.2.2 as-number 100
peer 2.2.2.2 ibgp-max-hop 2
peer 2.2.2.2 next-hop-local
peer 2.2.2.2 preference 60
