## User question:
How to configure Huawei router's BGP multi-instance to establish an EBGP session with peer 192.168.2.2 when they are not directly connected, allowing a maximum of 15 hops?
---
## Proposed answer:
ip vpn-instance vpna
ipv4-family
route-distinguisher 100:1
quit
bgp 100 instance a
ipv4-family vpn-instance vpna
peer 192.168.2.2 as-number 200
peer 192.168.2.2 ebgp-max-hop 15
---
## Router configuration manual:
CLIs:
