## User question:
"How to check BGP MDT routes with the same destination but differing source AS numbers on a Huawei router for VPN instance 'customer_vpn'?"
---
## Proposed answer:
display bgp vpnv4 all peer customer_vpn routing-table | include ^[0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+/[0-9]+
---
