## Router configuration manual:
CLIs:
private-4-byte-as enable
undo private-4-byte-as [ enable ]
FuncDef:
The private-4-byte-as enable command enables the 4-byte private AS number function.
The undo private-4-byte-as enable command disables the 4-byte private AS number function.
By default, the 4-byte private AS number function is not enabled, and the device supports 2-byte private AS numbers instead of 4-byte private AS numbers.
