display bgp routing-table peer <ipv6-address> { received-routes [ time-range <start-time> <end-time> ] | advertised-routes time-range <start-time> <end-time> }
display bgp routing-table route-filter <route-filter-name>
FuncDef:
The display bgp routing-table label command displays the labeled routes in the BGP routing table.
The display bgp labeled routing-table command displays information about BGP routes in a BGP labeled address family.
The display bgp routing-table command displays information about BGP public network routes.
ParaDef:
{'Parameters': 'peer ipv4-address', 'Info': 'Displays the IPv4 address of a peer on which public network routes are to be displayed.\nIt is in dotted decimal notation.'}
{'Parameters': 'received-routes', 'Info': 'Displays the public network routes received from a specified peer.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'time-range start-time', 'Info': 'Displays BGP VPNv4 routes that flap within the specified period. Starting time (<0-10000>d<0-23>h<0-59>m<0-59>s).\nThe value is an integer ranging from 0 to 4294967295.'}
{'Parameters': 'time-range end-time', 'Info': 'Displays BGP VPNv4 routes that flap within the specified period. Ending time (<0-10000>d<0-23>h<0-59>m<0-59>s).\nThe value is an integer ranging from 0 to 4294967295.'}
{'Parameters': 'advertised-routes', 'Info': 'Displays the public network routes advertised to a specified peer.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'as-path-filter as-path-filter-name', 'Info': 'Specifies the name of an AS_Path filter.\nThe value is a string of 1 to 51 case-sensitive characters, spaces not supported.'}
{'Parameters': 'as-path-filter as-path-filter-num', 'Info': 'Specifies the number of an AS_Path filter.\nThe value is an integer ranging from 1 to 256.'}
{'Parameters': 'regular-expression as-regular-expression', 'Info': 'Specifies the regular expression used to match the AS_Path information.\nThe value is a string of 1 to 80 characters.'}
{'Parameters': 'ipv6-address', 'Info': 'Specify an IPv6 peer address.\nThe value is a 32-digit hexadecimal number, in the format of X:X:X:X:X:X:X:X.'}
{'Parameters': 'route-filter route-filter-name', 'Info': 'Specifies the name of a route-filter.\nThe value is a string of 1 to 200 case-sensitive characters, spaces not supported. If parameters are included in the referenced route-filter, specify values for them in the format of (var1, var2, ...var8) behind the route-filter name. A maximum of eight parameters can be specified, and each value ranges from 1 to 200 characters.'}
---
