{'Parameters': 'isis', 'Info': 'Configures BGP to import IS-IS routes.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'rip', 'Info': 'Configures BGP to import RIP routes.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'processId', 'Info': 'Specifies the number of a process from which routes are to be imported.\nThe value is an integer ranging from 1 to 4294967295.'}
