How to configure a 15-second delay for releasing obtained labels in BGP multi-instance VPN instance IPv4 address family view on Huawei routers?
---
## Proposed answer:
system-view
ip vpn-instance vpna
ipv4-family
route-distinguisher 100:1
quit
