## Router configuration manual:
CLIs:
label-free delay <delay-value>
undo label-free delay <delay-value>
undo label-free delay
FuncDef:
The label-free delay command sets a delay in releasing obtained labels.
The undo label-free delay command cancels the configured delay in releasing obtained labels.
By default, no delay in releasing obtained labels is configured.
ParaDef:
{'Parameters': 'delay-value', 'Info': 'Specifies a delay in releasing obtained labels.\nThe value is an integer ranging from 0 to 180, in seconds.'}
