## User question:
How to configure a Huawei router to advertise BGP community attributes to peer 192.168.50.25 in VPNv4 address family?
---
## Proposed answer:
ip vpn-instance vpna
ipv4-family
route-distinguisher 100:1
vpn-target 111:1 both
quit
bgp 100 instance a
ipv4-family vpn-instance vrf1
peer 192.168.50.25 as-number 100
peer 192.168.50.25 advertise-community
