FuncDef:
The display bgp vpnv6 routing-table command displays BGP VPNv6 routes.
ParaDef:
{'Parameters': 'route-distinguisher route-distinguisher', 'Info': 'X.X.X.X:number or number:number or number.number:number.\nThe value is a string of 3 to 21 case-sensitive characters, spaces not supported. In addition, the VPN instance name must not be _public_. When double quotation marks are used around the string, spaces are allowed in the string.'}
{'Parameters': 'all', 'Info': 'Display all information on VPNv6 and IPv6 VPN instance.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'vpn-instance vpn-instance-name', 'Info': 'Specify a VPN-Instance (VRF) name.\nThe value is a string of 1 to 31 case-sensitive characters, spaces not supported. In addition, the VPN instance name must not be _public_. When double quotation marks are used around the string, spaces are allowed in the string.'}
{'Parameters': 'routing-table', 'Info': 'Display BGP routing table.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'statistics', 'Info': 'Statistics of route.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'community-filter basic-community-filter-number', 'Info': 'Specifies the number of a basic community filter.\nThe value is an integer ranging from 1 to 99.'}
{'Parameters': 'community-filter community-filter-name', 'Info': 'Specifies the name of a community filter.\nThe value is a string of 1 to 51 case-sensitive characters. The string cannot be all digits.'}
{'Parameters': 'community-filter advanced-community-filter-number', 'Info': 'Specifies the number of an advanced community filter.\nThe value is an integer ranging from 100 to 199.'}
{'Parameters': 'vpnv6', 'Info': 'VPNv6 address-family.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'community community-number', 'Info': 'Specify community number.\nThe value is an integer ranging from 0 to 4294967295.'}
{'Parameters': 'community aa:nn', 'Info': 'Specify aa<0-65535>:nn <0-65535>.\nThe value is a string of 1 to 11 case-sensitive characters, spaces not supported.'}
{'Parameters': 'internet', 'Info': 'Internet(well-known community attributes).\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'no-advertise', 'Info': 'Do not advertise to any peer(well-known community  attributes).\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'no-export', 'Info': 'Do not export to external peers(well-known community attributes).\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'no-export-subconfed', 'Info': 'Do not send routes outside a sub-confederation(well-known community attributes).\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'whole-match', 'Info': 'Complete match with specified communities.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'as-path-filter as-path-filter-num', 'Info': 'As-path-filter number.\nThe value is an integer ranging from 1 to 256.'}
{'Parameters': 'as-path-filter as-path-filter-name', 'Info': 'AS path filter name (the name is a string of 1 to 51 characters, which cannot contain only numbers.).\nThe value is a string of 1 to 51 case-sensitive characters, with spaces not supported. When double quotation marks are used around the string, spaces are allowed in the string.'}
{'Parameters': 'regular-expression as-regular-expression', 'Info': 'Displays the routes that match the regular expression.\nThe value is a string of 1 to 80 characters.'}
{'Parameters': 'active', 'Info': 'Active routes.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'ipv6-address', 'Info': 'Specify an ipv6 network address.\nThe value is a 32-digit hexadecimal number, in the format of X:X:X:X:X:X:X:X.'}
{'Parameters': 'prefix-length', 'Info': 'Specify network prefix length.\nThe value is an integer that ranges from 0 to 128.'}
{'Parameters': 'different-origin-as', 'Info': 'Routes with the same destination address&mask but originating from different origin ASs.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'label', 'Info': 'Labeled route information.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'best', 'Info': 'Best,add-path and best-external routes number.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'extcommunity', 'Info': 'Routes matched with ext-communities.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'rt', 'Info': 'Specify a route target extended community.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'soo', 'Info': 'Specify soo extended community.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'strExtCommunity', 'Info': 'Specifies the excommunity value. IP<X.X.X.X>:NN<0-65535> or AS<0-65535>:NN<0-4294967295> or AS<65536-4294967295>:NN<0-65535> or AS<0-65535>.<0-65535>:NN<0-65535>.\nThe attribute is a BGP extended community attribute and can be expressed in any of the following formats:\n2-byte AS number:4-byte user-defined number, for example, 1:3. The AS number ranges from 0 to 65535, and the user-defined number ranges from 0 to 4294967295. The AS number and user-defined number cannot both be set to 0. Specifically, the value of the SoO attribute cannot be 0:0.IPv4-address:2-byte user-defined number, for example, 192.168.122.15:1. The IP address ranges from 0.0.0.0 to 255.255.255.255, and the user-defined number ranges from 0 to 65535.Integral 4-byte AS number:2-byte user-defined number, for example, 0:3 or 65537:3. An AS number ranges from 65536 to 4294967295. A user-defined number ranges from 0 to 65535. The AS number and user-defined number cannot be both 0s. Specifically, the value of the SoO attribute cannot be 0:0.4-byte AS number in dotted notation:2-byte user-defined number, for example, 0.0:3 or 0.1:0. A 4-byte AS number in dotted notation is in the format of x.y, where x and y are integers ranging from 1 to 65535 and from 0 to 65535, respectively. A user-defined number ranges from 0 to 65535. The AS number and user-defined number cannot be both 0s. Specifically, the value of the SoO attribute cannot be 0.0:0.'}
{'Parameters': 'match-any', 'Info': 'Match anyone with specified extend communities.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'extcommunity-filter extcomm-filter-name', 'Info': 'Specifies the name of an extcommunity filter.\nThe value is a string of 1 to 51 case-sensitive characters. The string cannot be all digits.'}
{'Parameters': 'extcommunity-filter basic-extcomm-filter-number', 'Info': 'Specifies the number of an extcommunity filter.\nThe value is an integer ranging from 1 to 199.'}
{'Parameters': 'extcommunity-filter advanced-extcomm-filter-number', 'Info': 'Specifies the number of an advanced extcommunity filter.\nThe value is an integer ranging from 200 to 399.'}
{'Parameters': 'longer-prefixes', 'Info': 'Longer prefix match.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'large-community aa:bb:cc', 'Info': 'Specifies a value of the Large-Community attribute.\nThe value is in the format of a:b:c. The values of a, b, and c are integers ranging from 0 to 4294967295.'}
{'Parameters': 'large-community-filter large-community-filter-name', 'Info': 'large Community filter name (the name is a string of 1 to 51 characters, which cannot contain only numbers.).\nThe value is a string of 1 to 51 case-sensitive characters. The string cannot be all digits.'}
