CLIs:
filter-policy { <acl6-number> | ipv6-prefix <ipv6-prefix-name> | acl6-name <acl6-name> } { import | export [ direct | isis <process-id> | ospfv3 <process-id> | ripng <process-id> | static | unr ] }
undo filter-policy [ <acl6-number> | ipv6-prefix <ipv6-prefix-name> | acl6-name <acl6-name> ] { import | export [ direct | isis <process-id> | ospfv3 <process-id> | ripng <process-id> | static | unr ] }
FuncDef:
The filter-policy import command configures a device to filter received routes.
The undo filter-policy import command restores the default configuration.
The filter-policy export command configures a device to use an export policy to filter the routes to be advertised so that only the routes that match the export policy are advertised.
The undo filter-policy export command restores the default configuration.
By default, received routes or the routes to be advertised are not be filtered.
ParaDef:
{'Parameters': 'acl6-number', 'Info': 'Specifies the number of a basic ACL6.\nThe value is an integer that ranges from 2000 to 2999.'}
{'Parameters': 'ipv6-prefix ipv6-prefix-name', 'Info': 'Specifies the name of an IPv6 prefix list.\nThe name is a string of 1 to 169 case-sensitive characters, with spaces not supported. When double quotation marks are used around the string, spaces are allowed in the string.'}
{'Parameters': 'acl6-name acl6-name', 'Info': 'Specifies the name of a named basic ACL6.\nThe value is a string of 1 to 64 case-sensitive characters without spaces. The value must start with a letter (a to z or A to Z, case sensitive).'}
{'Parameters': 'direct', 'Info': 'Configures a device to filter the direct routes to be advertised.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'isis process-id', 'Info': 'Specifies the ID of an IS-IS process.\nThe value is an integer ranging from 1 to 4294967295.'}
{'Parameters': 'process-id', 'Info': 'Specifies the ID of a process in which routes are to be filtered.\nThe value is an integer ranging from 1 to 4294967295.'}
{'Parameters': 'ospfv3 process-id', 'Info': 'Specifies the ID of an OSPFv3 process.\nThe value is an integer ranging from 1 to 4294967295.'}
{'Parameters': 'ripng', 'Info': 'Specifies the RIPng.\nThe value is an integer ranging from 1 to 4294967295.'}
{'Parameters': 'static', 'Info': 'Configures a device to filter the static routes to be advertised.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'unr', 'Info': 'Configures a device to filter the UNR routes to be advertised.\n-'}
