## User question:
How to configure a Huawei router to verify that the first AS number in the AS_Path attribute matches the EBGP peer group "europe-peers" when receiving updates?
---
## Proposed answer:
ip as-path access-list 1 permit ^65000
peer-group europe-peers
peer europe-peers as-path-filter 1 in
---
## Router configuration manual:
CLIs:
