## User question:
How to configure a Huawei router to establish a BGP peer relationship with peer group "NYC_BRANCH" using fake AS number 65005 while allowing both actual and fake AS numbers, and prepending the actual AS number in outgoing routes?
---
## Proposed answer:
peer-group NYC_BRANCH
description BGP peer group for NYC Branch
as-number 65005 fake
peer-as 65005 allow-fake-as
maximum-prefix 1000
next-hop-local
peer NYC_BRANCH next-hop-self
peer NYC_BRANCH advertise-community
peer NYC_BRANCH route-policy PREPEND_AS export
route-policy PREPEND_AS
if-match as-path 65005
set as-path prepend 65005 0
end
---
